  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are two hollow concentric cubes enclosing charges <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>Q</mi></math> respectively as shown in figure. The ratio of electric flux passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is:</p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/25621612-d009-44de-a38c-5d703164eff1.png\" style=\"width: 290px; height: 290px;\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
